runtime inspection(object) -> snapshot
    Report host, process, worker, pulse timing, mailbox counters and visible references.
    Include active methods and outbound waits with chain, target and start time.
    Mark foreign state as potentially containing additional references.

retention explanation(object) -> sampled root path
    Explore visible references from registered roots, avoiding cycles.
    Return one root path when found; retain unavailable identifiers and time bounds.
    Explain that an absent visible path does not establish unreachability.

call tracking
    Register activity on entry and remove it on success or failure.

Include the current debugger snapshot in RuntimeInspection.

Expose immutable clone origin and hash of the loaded native method hierarchy.

Runtime inspection includes a consistent PromiseSnapshot without waiting for a normal mailbox call.
